RustGL universal renderer plugin for Minecraft: Java Edition launchers on Android
================================================================================

This package (np.com.gurkha.rustgl.plugin) is a renderer plugin: it contains the
RustGL renderer library `librust_gl.so` for arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, x86 and
x86_64, plugin meta-data for the FCL / Zalith RendererPlugin v1 and v2
contracts, and a small information Activity. It contains no game, no Minecraft
assets and no third-party tracking code.

Renderer library: RustGL
------------------------
* Library: librust_gl.so, built from the Rust workspace in `rustgl/` of this
  repository.
* Synced unmodified from Gurkha Launcher
  <https://github.com/kushaladhikari982648-lgtm/Gurkha-launcher>, directory
  `rustgl/`, branch `arena/a8e9723f-gurkha-launcher`, commit 1726782a
  (tree bbeac11aa95dff9509a8d91c6cb6477168cff206).
  `python3 tools/check_sync.py` verifies the copy byte for byte.
* Upstream of that code: <https://github.com/whaltermc/rust-renderer>,
  revision eb22559.
* Upstream publishes no licence file. Until its author adds one, this renderer
  code is redistributed as "used with the author's permission"; it is NOT
  covered by the MIT licence below and no licence is claimed for it. Please
  keep this notice with any copy and replace the library freely - the plugin
  format exists precisely so that a renderer can be swapped out.

